{"id":"d_main_27_06","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch27","label":"Chapter 27 · Exploration"},"label":"Clear Purpose","stage":"27-21 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_27_05","next":"d_main_27_07","speakers":{"elegg":"Elegg","rapi":"Rapi","liveryn":"Liveryn","neon":"Neon","hammering":"Hammering"},"icons":{"elegg":"si_c500_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","liveryn":"si_c480_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","hammering":"si_c490_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_27_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_1","text":"I'll let you know what Ms. Hammering and I have turned up so far.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"E2Crystal","bgArt":"e2crystal","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_aztec","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_2","text":"These crystals absorb the energy of anything they have physical contact with for an extended period.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_3","text":"If the crystal touches anything that has energy flowing through it, it will suck it dry,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_4","text":"and proceed to expand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_5","text":"The reason for this expansion seems simple, in that it allows them to occupy a wider surface area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_6","text":"Do you all recall how my tablet ran out of power before?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_7","text":"It wasn't a charging issue. The crystal simply drained the energy from the tablet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_8","text":"Do you have any evidence to support that theory?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_9","text":"I ran several experiments with my backup batteries, and got the same result each time: completely drained.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_10","text":"I even touched the crystal myself, and sure enough, my core output dropped ever so slightly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_11","text":"If I had kept my hand on any longer, I would have ended up like our Rapture friend from earlier.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_12","text":"You experimented using your own body? Your pursuit of knowledge is unmatched.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_13","text":"I did pay a price for it, however.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_14","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_15","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_15","text":"Elegg shows us the palm of her hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ManyCrystalDesert_d","bgArt":"manycrystaldesert_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["elegg","rapi","liveryn","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_16","text":"Notice anything unusual?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_17","text":"Oh my goodness! What are all those holes in your hand?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_18","text":"How did you notice so quickly...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_19","text":"Anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_20","text":"Yes, there is a preponderance of small holes on my hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_21","text":"Have any of them pierced all the way through?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_22","text":"Yes, or at least they attempted to do so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_23","text":"These crystals clearly wanted to absorb all of my energy, and chose to use my hand as an entry point to my core.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_24","text":"Once I removed my hand from the crystals and cut off the power supply to it for a while, I was okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_25","text":"But what if there's a fragment or something left over in your hand?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_26","text":"There's no need to worry about that. I've conducted experiments which cover that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["hammering"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_27","text":"Ms. Hammering, could you explain?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_28","text":"Of course.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_29","text":"These crystals absorb energy from other sources and store it inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_30","text":"And they then convert into electricity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_31","text":"Yes, which explains why they've got electricity coursing through them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_32","text":"The disintegration we saw earlier is when they run out of electricity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_33","text":"Think of it like a plant going without water. They're dying because of a lack of nutrients.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_34","text":"In other words, my hand is fine, because I cut off the nutrients.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_35","text":"Another thing of note.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_36","text":"The isolated fragments crumble, but the ones stuck in the ground seem to be fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_37","text":"So I did some digging.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_38","text":"The crystals are all interconnected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_39","text":"So all the crystals in this area are connected underground?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_40","text":"Seems like it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_41","text":"Just like tree roots.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_42","text":"So that means...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_43","text":"There has to be an origin point for these bad boys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_44","text":"I propose using a rather simple method to find it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_45","text":"Let's say we run into a particularly large crystal shard up ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_46","text":"If we cut it in half,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_47","text":"one half will shatter, whereas the other half will remain intact.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_48","text":"If we proceed in the direction of the side that remains intact,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_49","text":"we might end up reaching the source of all these crystals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_50","text":"Also,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_51","text":"while further investigation is required, I have a premonition that there is a flowing current within the crystals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_06_52","text":"Suppose these crystals are like the roots of a tree,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainSc